An authored rowspan or colspan on a cell is dropped

```
|{rowspan=2} a | b |
| c | d |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|{colspan=3 .k} a | b |
| ^ | d |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td rowspan="2" class="k">a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|>{align=left} a |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td align="left" style="text-align: right;">a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
